`ConsecutiveRatios` proves that `(π - α_n^virt) / (π - α_{n+1})` (`n` even) and
`(π - α_{n+1}^virt) / (π - α_n)` (`n` odd) have asymptotic expansions in powers of `1 / (n + 1)`
with coefficient sequences `deficitRatioEvenC` and `deficitRatioOddC`, and evaluates the
coefficients of orders `0` and `1`.  This file evaluates the next three:
`deficitRatioEvenC_two`, `_three`, `_four` and `deficitRatioOddC_two`, `_three`, `_four`.

The file is generated by `work/gen_deficit_ratio.py`; every value stated here is proved by the
kernel from the definitions (the rational tables `oddAngTab`, `evenAngTab` are those of
`AngleAllOrders`).
-/

namespace PrivateApex
